      "romaji": "nana, hachi, kyū, jū",
      "english": "7, 8, 9, 10",
      "registerNotes": "7 is なな when spoken alone (しち is ambiguous over noise); 9 is きゅう alone but く in 九時 (9 o'clock).",
      "audio": "audio/ja/num-03.mp3",
      "audioHint": "なな、はち、きゅう、じゅう",
      "tags": ["numbers", "essential"],
      "difficulty": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "num-04",
